Sorting and compact spacing can be combined.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight print --density compact --sort-declarations

========== API ==========

print({ density: 'compact', sortDeclarations: true })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
tag Reviewed
account Equity:Opening
commodity USD
P 2024-01-01 USD 2 SEK
account Assets:Cash
; Root comment
2024-01-01 Opening ; :Reviewed:
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

; Root comment
account Equity:Opening
account Assets:Cash
tag Reviewed
commodity SEK
  default
commodity USD
P 2024-01-01 USD 2 SEK
2024-01-01 Opening  ; :Reviewed:
    Assets:Cash     1 SEK
    Equity:Opening  -1 SEK
